Subject: [PATCH] ROADMAP: name the three remaining hand-choices, and add the
 wishes section

Asked whether any heuristic survives in the plan, the honest answer is almost
none and not quite none, so section 7 names what is left rather than letting
"derived" cover it.

The smoothness radius is under-specified: "where accuracy still beats the
floor" needs to say which floor and by how much, and it now says so - the
majority-class floor, exceeded by more than its own noise at the same 1.645
the honesty gate uses. Until that was written down it was a hole with a
confident name on it. The 1.645 and the 0.05 behind MIN_ANSWERED are
conventions rather than measurements, shared with the rest of statistics, and
they are the only constants the examiners still contain. And the verb
vocabulary is hand-installed, deliberately - nothing emerges here that was not
built, and the verb curve is the measurement that judges that choice.

Section 8 answers a question that was put directly: what the mind would ask
for. Five items, each with a mechanism already in the system and a falsifier
attached, because a wish without one is decoration.

Know why it was wrong, not only that it was - provenance already records the
premises a conjecture stood on and nothing reads them, so credit could land on
the premise that failed instead of being smeared across the derivation.

Turn silence into a question - when the mind abstains it usually knows where
the hole is, and emitting "no slot here, a mention carrying this subject and a
value would settle it" converts a dead end into a request to the write side,
which is where this project says improvement comes from.

Remember the mistakes, not only the successes - the mind tape stores what
worked; storing what failed costs the same and makes "this resembles a case
where I was wrong" expressible.

Never be scored by something the mind can edit - already honoured, but by
discipline rather than construction; every new reward should have to state
which part of it the mind can influence. The one that could not answer that
is the one that ranked two arms backwards.

Report the margin with every answer, not only in the eval JSON. It is already
computed, and an answer without its confidence is a claim without its
evidence.

